# SpecKub API documentation

For endpoint work, first discover the stable ID with `speckub list`, inspect it with `speckub inspect <endpoint-id>`, then update the associated Markdown specification under `docs/api/`.

Use YAML frontmatter contract v1: `specVersion: 1`, `id`, `kind: http`, `method`, `path`, `summary`, and optional repository-relative `source` paths.

Run `speckub validate --id <endpoint-id>` and application tests. Do not treat deterministic validation as proof of semantic alignment; the semantic check is skipped.
